  "content": "<p>此模組受《Beyond the Woods》（Archi 製作）啟發，並為你的 Minecraft 世界新增了多種怪物。</p><p>幾乎所有怪物都會生成在原版的森林生態系中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">此模組使用 MCreator 製作</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">模組圖示：</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Zc</span>oper</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">需要 GeckoLib！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">用於搶先看及新模組發布的 Discord 伺服器：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zqXSaMAgVw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/zqXSaMAgVw</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">模組專用材質包：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-woodstalker-old\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-woodstalker-old</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">請勿移植我的模組！</span></span></p>",
